      "description": {
        "en": "An Amazon Bedrock API key, sent as a bearer token. Short-term keys last at most 12 hours and are bound to a region; nothing renews them.",
        "zh": "Amazon Bedrock 的 API Key，以 Bearer 令牌发送。短期 Key 最长 12 小时有效且绑定区域，不会自动续期。"
      },
      "form": {
